# L §2.4 Version items (tally 2.1.7 R9, issue #148; #111, P3): keys of different literal kinds at one position
# of a lone part (its index not loaded) sort by kind first, in lit's order (a number, a date, a month-day, a key, a
# duration, true / false), then by value; the reprint is a fixed point. 2.1.6's refcore sorted them as text.
=== options reprint
=== s.tally
scenario s over m
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

version w
  cite c
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  x[q1] = 1
  x[true] = 1
  x[3 years] = 1
  x[2026-03] = 1
  x[0315] = 1
  x[10] = 1
  x[2026-02-01] = 1
  x[2.5] = 1
